# loop design rows: copy of compiled ladder constants (v1).
# Designers change numbers here without a Rust edit; the game reads
# the header version row at a progression boundary. Whole numbers only,
# `#` comments, no floats. Glory is counts (no suffix). Range checks
# are validate_loop in crates/game/src/loop_text.rs; the compiled
# constants stay the truth for replays. Rank names stay in code.
table loop version 1
